    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007150/extras/bcd44bf4eca68354693b21cb0fbe5637.poster.avif?t=1753338667\" width=450 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007150/extras/bcd44bf4eca68354693b21cb0fbe5637.webm?t=1753338667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Demons from another world are coming, leading the allied forces of the Six Races to resist them. Choose your main race and heroes independently and form your team through a Rogue mechanism. Purchase equipment, runes and talents to continuously enhance the overall combat effectiveness, so that you can win in waves of enemy attacks!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 races, 24 heroes, 40 units\uff0c6 towers</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>80+ equipment, 150+ runes and talents, in addition to being extracted through Rogue mechanism, it can also be dropped by defeating neutral creatures</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enjoy the joy of controlling multiple units in combat through the traditional RTS operation method</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Most of the abilities are passive or can be cast automatically, which reduces the operating pressure while retaining the upper limit of operation</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Production and construction have been simplified to focus on fast-paced combat</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Plan the construction route, change the main race when conditions are met, and experience endless hero combinations</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007150/extras/bcd44bf4eca68354693b21cb0fbe5637.poster.avif?t=1753338667\" width=450 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007150/extras/bcd44bf4eca68354693b21cb0fbe5637.webm?t=1753338667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Demons from another world are coming, leading the allied forces of the Six Races to resist them. Choose your main race and heroes independently and form your team through a Rogue mechanism. Purchase equipment, runes and talents to continuously enhance the overall combat effectiveness, so that you can win in waves of enemy attacks!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 races, 24 heroes, 40 units\uff0c6 towers</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>80+ equipment, 150+ runes and talents, in addition to being extracted through Rogue mechanism, it can also be dropped by defeating neutral creatures</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enjoy the joy of controlling multiple units in combat through the traditional RTS operation method</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Most of the abilities are passive or can be cast automatically, which reduces the operating pressure while retaining the upper limit of operation</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Production and construction have been simplified to focus on fast-paced combat</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Plan the construction route, change the main race when conditions are met, and experience endless hero combinations</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Demons from another world are coming, leading the allied forces of the Six Races to resist them. Choose your hero, build and continuously strengthen your team, and enjoy the collision of traditional RTS and Rogue mechanics in this world of sword and magic!",
